Source: qemu-manager
Section: virt
Priority: optional
Maintainer: QEMU Manager Contributors <qemu-manager@example.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), meson, ninja-build, pkg-config, libgtk-4-dev
Standards-Version: 4.6.0
Homepage: https://github.com/driftcore-gif/qemu-manager

Package: qemu-manager
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, qemu-utils
Recommends: qemu-system-x86
Description: QEMU virtual machine manager (no root, no libvirt)
 A native GTK4 desktop application that manages QEMU virtual machines
 by generating and launching QEMU commands directly. No root required,
 no libvirt, no systemd dependency. Works in Termux + PRoot.
